==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|со-|t1=co|труд|t2=work, labor|-ник}}. Typologically compare {{noncog|fr|collaborateur}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сотру́дник}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сотрудник.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|сотру́дник|a=an|f=сотру́дница|adj=сотру́днический}}

# {{lb|ru|literary|dated}} [[collaborator]], [[colleague]], [[assistant]]
#: {{syn|ru|коллабора́тор|колле́га}}
# [[employee]], [[associate]]
#: {{syn|ru|слу́жащий|рабо́тник}}
# {{lb|ru|in the plural}} [[staff]]
# {{lb|ru|journalism}} [[contributor]], [[author]] {{gl|a person who regularly writes articles for a newspaper or a journal, or writes entries for a multi-part work, e.g. an encyclopedia}}

